<h1>Hi there!</h1>
<p>
  Someone (hopefully you) requested a link to reset the password for the XIVAuth account associated with this email
  address. If this was you, click the button below to get back in to your account. If this <em>wasn't</em> you, you can
  safely ignore this email.
</p>

<div class="btn-cta-wrap">
  <%= link_to "Reset your password", reset_user_password_url(reset_password_token: @token), class: "btn bg-primary",
              target: "_blank" %>
</div>

<p>
  <strong>The link above will only work for the next <%= @link_ttl %>.</strong> A new link can be requested at any time
  via the <%= link_to "Reset Password", @new_reset_url %> form.
</p>

<p>
  Thanks,
  <br>XIVAuth User Management Service
</p>

<hr class="divider">

<p class="fine-print">
  If you're having trouble with the button above, copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br>
  <span style="font-family: monospace;"><%= reset_user_password_url(reset_password_token: @token) %></span>
</p>
